        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is the cost calculated for shifting household items from Mumbai to Kolkata?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The cost is primarily based on the total weight of your belongings, the distance of approximately 2,150 km, and the type of service you select. Base freight rates cover standard packing, while additional charges apply for fragile items, vehicle transport, stair‑carry, and any special handling. Fuel surcharge, GST, and insurance are added transparently, ensuring you receive a detailed, item‑wise quotation.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documentation is required for a smooth Mumbai‑to‑Kolkata relocation?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You will need a valid government‑issued ID, proof of residence at both origin and destination, a detailed inventory list, and the e‑Way bill for goods transport. If you are claiming reimbursement from a corporate or government entity, provide the official invoice and GST‑compliant bill. Our team assists in preparing all paperwork to avoid delays at checkposts.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is my furniture fully insured during the transit from Mumbai to Kolkata?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. All shipments are covered by an IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance policy that offers 100 % declared‑value coverage. In the unlikely event of loss or damage, you can file a claim with supporting photographs and the original invoice. Our IBA‑approved status ensures the claim process is swift and hassle‑free.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does it typically take for packers and movers Mumbai to Kolkata to deliver my goods?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Under normal traffic conditions, the transit time ranges from 5 to 7 days, including loading, highway travel, and unloading at the destination. Real‑time GPS tracking allows you to monitor progress, and our logistics team coordinates with checkpoint authorities to minimize stoppage time, ensuring timely delivery.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I ship my two‑wheelers or cars along with household goods on the same route?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. We operate dedicated multi‑car trailers equipped with hydraulic loading ramps, wheel chocks, and high‑tensile ratchet lashings. Vehicle transport is priced separately but can be bundled with your household move for a consolidated invoice, providing a seamless door‑to‑door relocation experience.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What makes Shree Ashirwad Packers and Movers stand out among cheap movers in Kolkata?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Beyond competitive pricing, we offer a 120‑plus fleet of specialized container trucks, ISO 9001:2015 quality management, live GPS tracking, and a 7‑layer protective packaging system. Our 4.9/5.0 Google rating, IBA approval, and 100 % insurance coverage guarantee reliability, safety, and peace of mind that cheap movers often cannot match.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the instant shifting estimate tool work for a Mumbai to Kolkata move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The tool captures your pickup and delivery addresses, inventory details, and any special requirements. It then calculates distance‑based freight, applies current fuel surcharge, and adds optional services like packing or vehicle transport. Within minutes you receive a detailed, itemized quote that you can download or share with your employer for reimbursement.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
